    "help_meta_desc" => "How to set up and use dopeIPTV: playlists, the programme guide, timeshift, recording, multiview, your own files, casting and what to do when something goes wrong.",
    "help_eyebrow" => "Help",
    "help_h1" => "How to use dopeIPTV",
